 "about_text": "Megan Mulrooney is a contemporary art gallery on Santa Monica Boulevard in Los Angeles, founded in 2024 by Megan Mulrooney, a lifelong Angeleno and former senior director at Nino Mier Gallery. The gallery represents emerging and mid-career artists from Los Angeles and abroad, staging solo exhibitions alongside artist-curated group presentations that encourage artists to participate in curatorial discourse. Its program blends a traditional commercial model with a collaborative, artist-forward ethos historically associated with the LA art scene, fostering cross-generational dialogue across two to three exhibitions per cycle. The gallery occupies a space formerly run by Nino Mier Gallery and has quickly built a presence on the national art fair circuit.",
